| `traceability.gaps.<id>` | string | `{}` | the id of a unit, a criterion or a requirement that has none, mapped to a non-blank reason | `scripts/traceability.py` (`judge`) | Gives one unit no test names the verdict `gap`; an entry for a covered, undefined or malformed id is a finding, and a blank reason is refused with exit 2. | a project with no requirement at all: `traceability.no_requirements` | always |
